1
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:11,780
What are you staring at?

2
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,170
Master?

3
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,060
Master!

4
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,590
Master?

5
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,130
Master?

6
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,180
Is your master's true form a log?

7
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,540
Don't talk about him like that.

8
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:44,970
Master?

9
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:48,410
Back in Luoshen Valley,

10
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,170
Master said

11
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,360
the soul crystal had been repaired.

12
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:51,680
But it seems

13
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,410
only his physical body has been restored.

14
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:54,490
His spirit

15
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,740
may only awaken

16
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,370
once we're back in the present.

17
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:14,220
Qi Fengyin,

18
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,060
stay here and watch over my master.

19
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:19,790
You can't exactly help Youyou

20
00:01:19,790 --> 00:01:20,650
with her love life, can you?

21
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,450
Let's split the work.

22
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:23,700
You stay here and look after

23
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:24,640
my master's body.

24
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:26,160
I'll help Youyou get betrothed

25
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:26,890
and get the talisman.

26
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:28,530
No.

27
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:31,370
For my master's sake

28
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:33,870
and for Youyou, who's in the Saintess's hands,

29
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:35,210
this can't wait.

30
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:35,880
You don't get to say no!

31
00:01:58,020 --> 00:02:03,900
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

32
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:11,900
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

33
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:17,180
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

34
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:28,420
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

35
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:35,540
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

36
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:43,420
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

37
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:51,460
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

38
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:59,580
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

39
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:06,140
[Blossom in Darkness]

40
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:08,140
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

41
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:11,140
[Episode 17]

42
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:25,850
What are you doing?

43
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,300
Why are you hiding your face?

44
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,890
Are you afraid someone will recognize you?

45
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,570
Why is everyone so scared of you?

46
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:34,060
What's your true form?

47
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,220
That's none of your business.

48
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,510
With Qi Fengyin around,

49
00:03:42,510 --> 00:03:43,390
I can't eat you.

50
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:45,060
But if you anger me,

51
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,780
you're not getting the Demon Soul Talisman.

52
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:51,010
Why are you taking me to Yunyi Sect?

53
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,060
Have you come up with a plan?

54
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,180
Yesterday, you only let me

55
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:57,280
catch a glimpse of Shen Wangyan.

56
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:59,070
How am I supposed to know

57
00:03:59,070 --> 00:03:59,770
his personality

58
00:03:59,770 --> 00:04:00,410
or what he likes?

59
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,300
I know nothing about him.

60
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,170
How can we appeal to his tastes?

61
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:03,690
So of course we need

62
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:04,610
to get to know him properly first.

63
00:04:04,730 --> 00:04:06,130
Then don't waste your time.

64
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:08,500
I know everything there is to know

65
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,220
about Shen Wangyan.

66
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:12,660
Yunyi Sect

67
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,730
[Yunyi Sect]
is a minor immortal sect.

68
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:19,220
As its leader, Shen Wangyan

69
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,810
rarely leaves the sect grounds.

70
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:33,900
♪Moonlight spills before Luoliang's towers♪

71
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:37,660
♪The evening breeze caresses your face...♪

72
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,370
He rises at the same time each morning to train

73
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,250
and study cultivation techniques.

74
00:04:43,180 --> 00:04:48,060
♪Yet my longing only grows harder to soothe...♪

75
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,660
At noon, he tends the herb garden,

76
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,660
carefully looking after the sect's

77
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,700
flowers and medicinal herbs.

78
00:04:57,860 --> 00:05:02,980
♪Let the years become two butterflies breaking free of their cocoons...♪

79
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:07,410
He works hard at his own cultivation,

80
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,980
takes great care of his disciples,

81
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,050
and runs the sect's affairs efficiently.

82
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,820
♪Grace in every step♪

83
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:18,540
♪I wander the mortal world for you alone...♪

84
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,460
There's just one thing

85
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,780
I haven't figured out.

86
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:22,810
Behind the platform where he plays his zither

87
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,050
is a bamboo hut protected by a seal.

88
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,610
He spends two hours in that hut

89
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:28,900
every day,

90
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:31,140
but I have no idea what for.

91
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:32,980
What's more,

92
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,810
every time he comes out,

93
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,460
he's terribly weak.

94
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,050
I've thought about going in to investigate,

95
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,290
but if anyone triggers the seal,

96
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,490
Shen Wangyan will know.

97
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,490
Anyway, apart from that little hut,

98
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,140
I know him

99
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:52,140
inside out.

100
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,660
I may

101
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,930
have only spoken to him once,

102
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,050
but I can tell

103
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:58,220
he's a man of noble character,

104
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,700
a truly kind and honorable man.

105
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:05,320
If Shen Wangyan finds out you've been

106
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,390
spying on him every day,

107
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,220
I'm afraid

108
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:08,050
you'll never make

109
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:08,880
a good impression on him.

110
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:10,250
Then what do I do?

111
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,610
But I'm a demon!

112
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:15,740
But I'm a demon.

113
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:17,290
I can't just

114
00:06:17,290 --> 00:06:18,220
rush up to him

115
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,660
and say,

116
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:21,610
"I'm a good demon who doesn't kill needlessly,"

117
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,540
can I?

118
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,410
When you captured me,

119
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,850
you didn't seem

120
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,020
like a good demon who doesn't kill needlessly.

121
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,050
You're not even human.

122
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,610
Nor are you a demon.

123
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,580
You're an herb spirit.

124
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,220
So you don't count.

125
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,540
Just tell me already.

126
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,250
What exactly should I do next?

127
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,170
Anyway,

128
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,900
catering to his tastes won't work.

129
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,700
I can't play a note on that zither.

130
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,810
Even if you spy on him like this

131
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,370
for 100 years,

132
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,050
you'll never form a bond with him.

133
00:06:46,950 --> 00:06:47,830
We need to find a chance

134
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:49,220
for you two to get to know each other.

135
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:51,850
Find a chance.

136
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,660
What are they doing?

137
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:03,850
You mean the lanterns?

138
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:07,780
Tomorrow is New Year's Day.

139
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,490
There's a Demon Lantern Festival on New Year's Eve.

140
00:07:09,870 --> 00:07:11,760
- We demons love firelight. - Higher!

141
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:12,700
Luoliang Demon Capital

142
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,930
was only recently built,

143
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,460
but we still

144
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:16,580
observe these traditions.

145
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:20,130
How about inviting Shen Wangyan here

146
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:21,620
to spend New Year's Eve with you?

147
00:07:22,270 --> 00:07:24,460
Going to the Demon Lantern Festival together

148
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,770
will help you get to know each other better.

149
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:28,580
Let him see how

150
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,370
the demons here live and work in peace,

151
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,540
making a living by farming,

152
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,220
without ever troubling mortals.

153
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,490
Then

154
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,590
I'll secretly arrange

155
00:07:35,590 --> 00:07:37,100
a few little incidents to bring you closer,

156
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,170
and sparks are bound to fly.

157
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:44,730
He's from an immortal sect.

158
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:46,290
What if he refuses to come here?

159
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,140
Then we'll just have to resort

160
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:52,020
to some extraordinary measures.

161
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:02,100
My master can't move.

162
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,050
Make sure

163
00:08:03,270 --> 00:08:04,810
you take him outside for some sun often.

164
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,540
It'll help his spirit recover.

165
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,980
If I just tossed you out the window,

166
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:11,140
she'd get upset again.

167
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:33,180
[Huanxia Pavilion]

168
00:08:50,150 --> 00:08:52,180
How can my malice be here?

169
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:55,060
It's so faint.

170
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,650
Am I imagining it?

171
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:14,700
Qi Fengyin?

172
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:20,650
Why are you carrying my master?

173
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,980
Didn't you say he needed more sun?

174
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,300
You could've just gotten him a chair.

175
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,890
No need to keep carrying him like this.

176
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,420
Take him back upstairs first.

177
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:32,770
There's something more important to do.

178
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,530
It's an emergency.

179
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:44,420
[Yaohua Garden]

180
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,460
Master,

181
00:09:58,910 --> 00:09:59,830
two devils, a man and a woman,

182
00:09:59,830 --> 00:10:00,540
have stormed in

183
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,760
and are wreaking havoc!

184
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,460
We can't hold them off!

185
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:04,060
What?

186
00:10:04,860 --> 00:10:06,020
[Yunyi Sect]

187
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:08,940
Who dares cause trouble here?

188
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,700
Master!

189
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:17,340
Yunyi Sect has always sought peace.

190
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,060
We have no quarrel with either of you.

191
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,530
Why are you attacking our sect?

192
00:10:22,630 --> 00:10:24,010
My travels brought me here.

193
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,250
I wanted a place to rest.

194
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:27,650
If you only wanted a rest,

195
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:28,940
I'd have welcomed you as guests.

196
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,420
Why hurt my disciples

197
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:31,820
and disturb our peace?

198
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,060
Because I've changed my mind.

199
00:10:36,510 --> 00:10:38,460
This really is a beautiful place,

200
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,980
but those immortal disciples

201
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:40,650
are an eyesore.

202
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,980
Better to kill them all.

203
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,580
I'll start with you.

204
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,370
How dare you!

205
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:47,940
Protect me.

206
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,530
I won't let you hurt them!

207
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:18,180
Who are you, demoness?

208
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:19,610
You're not from an immortal sect.

209
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:20,580
Stay out of this.

210
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,890
I've always despised evildoers.

211
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,060
I uphold justice and vanquish evil.

212
00:11:25,270 --> 00:11:26,010
What other reason do I need?

213
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,060
I'm hurt.

214
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,340
He's... He's hurt!

215
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,850
You insolent demoness!

216
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,060
How dare you hurt my Fengxian!

217
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,250
I'll settle this score

218
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,490
with you another day!

219
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:55,890
Miss!

220
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:57,940
Miss.

221
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:02,610
Miss?

222
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,530
You're awake.

223
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,610
We met last time

224
00:12:32,030 --> 00:12:33,100
because of the Floating Shadow Zither.

225
00:12:33,870 --> 00:12:35,250
I never expected that this time,

226
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:36,460
you'd save my sect.

227
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,730
You still remember me?

228
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:40,220
Of course.

229
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:42,130
You're the only one who's tried to steal the zither

230
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:42,730
in nearly a century.

231
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:43,940
How could I forget?

232
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,580
I am Shen Wangyan.

233
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:50,580
May I ask your name?

234
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:55,850
I'm Youyou.

235
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:57,610
Consider this

236
00:12:58,270 --> 00:13:00,300
my way of making amends for what I did before.

237
00:13:02,910 --> 00:13:04,010
You saved my disciples

238
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:04,770
from being slaughtered.

239
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,740
Giving you the Floating Shadow Zither

240
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:07,450
would be the least I could do.

241
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:08,930
If you like it,

242
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:09,770
once you're feeling better,

243
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,300
I'll bring it to your place.

244
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,940
I don't want your zither.

245
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,130
Then...

246
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,220
If you really want to thank me,

247
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:19,980
tomorrow's New Year's Eve.

248
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,580
There's a Demon Lantern Festival in Luoliang Demon Capital.

249
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:24,220
I was wondering if you...

250
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,250
Would you

251
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,530
like to...?

252
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,650
Are you asking me to go to the festival

253
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,490
with you on New Year's Eve?

254
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:46,730
All right.

255
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:47,850
I'll go with you.

256
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:01,980
That was close.

257
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,180
A couple more moves,

258
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:03,980
and you'd have given yourself away.

259
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,290
Don't use your techniques again,

260
00:14:06,290 --> 00:14:06,730
all right?

261
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,580
All right.

262
00:14:13,630 --> 00:14:14,530
It worked!

263
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:15,940
Shen Wangyan agreed to go with me

264
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:16,980
to the Demon Lantern Festival!

265
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:17,720
Really?

266
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:18,490
That's great!

267
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,130
It was worth playing

268
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:19,820
the villain for you!

269
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,850
And thank you to Qi Fengyin,

270
00:14:23,910 --> 00:14:24,700
the mighty devil himself.

271
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,700
That move of yours was amazing.

272
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:27,860
Could you teach it to me?

273
00:14:27,860 --> 00:14:29,600
Or could you do it again?

274
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,340
So, Shen Wangyan is going

275
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,580
to the demon capital with you?

276
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,600
Yes!

277
00:14:33,780 --> 00:14:34,610
I finally did it!

278
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,900
I snuck out

279
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,180
just to share the good news with you.

280
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,100
I'd better hurry back

281
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,060
before someone notices.

282
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:39,890
I'll stay

283
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:40,820
at Yunyi Sect and keep up

284
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:41,820
the injured act for another day.

285
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,770
You head back first.

286
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,100
I'm counting on you two for the festival!

287
00:14:51,150 --> 00:14:52,010
I never knew Youyou

288
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,940
had this side to her.

289
00:14:53,390 --> 00:14:55,220
I wonder why, 900 years later,

290
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,340
only a remnant of her soul is left.

291
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:58,700
What if Shen Wangyan isn't

292
00:14:58,750 --> 00:14:59,250
a good man?

293
00:14:59,550 --> 00:15:01,490
Cultivators and demons have long been at odds, after all.

294
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:05,100
Get them married and take the talisman.

295
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,890
Then we'll kill him.

296
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:09,850
All right.

297
00:15:10,750 --> 00:15:12,490
That'll get rid of the problem for good.

298
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:16,820
But then,

299
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,730
wouldn't we be killing an innocent man?

300
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,220
Qi Fengyin, you're leading me astray again!

301
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:25,940
You're messing with me?

302
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:26,850
I'll...!

303
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,700
I smell flowers.

304
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,340
Pear blossoms.

305
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,190
The flowers outside Luoliang

306
00:15:44,190 --> 00:15:45,220
are blooming so early.

307
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,580
I just

308
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,060
stepped out for some fresh air.

309
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:04,650
I saw you in the woods

310
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,250
meeting with those two.

311
00:16:14,790 --> 00:16:15,530
Yunyi Sect

312
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:16,850
may be

313
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,700
small and obscure,

314
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,650
but you have no right

315
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:19,770
to toy with it as you please.

316
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:22,610
No,

317
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,930
I've never treated your sect

318
00:16:24,930 --> 00:16:25,940
like a toy.

319
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:27,100
What else do you want?

320
00:16:27,790 --> 00:16:29,420
I've agreed to give you the Floating Shadow Zither.

321
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,060
What more can you possibly get from me?

322
00:16:31,390 --> 00:16:32,460
Do you have to toy with me like this

323
00:16:32,630 --> 00:16:34,020
just to amuse yourself?

324
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,180
It's not like that.

325
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,460
I never meant to toy with you.

326
00:16:39,510 --> 00:16:40,940
Never set foot in Yunyi Sect again.

327
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:42,650
I don't want to see you again.

328
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:45,940
Wait.

329
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:48,100
Master,

330
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,770
Elder Lingyue's taken a turn for the worse.

331
00:17:13,830 --> 00:17:14,420
Lingyue.

332
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,380
What are you trying to do now?

333
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:46,940
Demonic aura is eating away at her body.

334
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:49,050
I can draw it out of her.

335
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:29,660
Youyou.

336
00:18:40,270 --> 00:18:41,090
She's my senior sister.

337
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:42,980
When she was young, she was tainted

338
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:43,940
by demonic aura while saving me.

339
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:46,420
It's tormented her ever since,

340
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,330
giving her no peace at all.

341
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:50,900
I owe her more than I could ever repay.

342
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,050
Thank you

343
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:54,730
for helping her.

344
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:57,490
You don't need to thank me.

345
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,460
I was wrong to deceive you before.

346
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:03,860
But I really

347
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,050
never meant to toy with you.

348
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:11,570
Youyou,

349
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,140
does your invitation to the Demon Lantern Festival

350
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:18,380
still stand?

351
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:40,580
[Wuchang Prison]

352
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,730
Open the portal.

353
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:57,140
You're the Saintess of the Tides now,

354
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,090
wielding divine power.

355
00:19:58,110 --> 00:19:59,180
If even you can't do it,

356
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,490
how could I manage it?

357
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,430
The Demon Soul Talisman already

358
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:04,080
used up all its spiritual power last time.

359
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:05,780
Without my demonic core,

360
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:06,940
I'm powerless.

361
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,570
Keeping me prisoner won't help you.

362
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,900
They don't belong in the past.

363
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,860
If they stay there too long,

364
00:20:14,110 --> 00:20:15,380
they'll cause a catastrophe.

365
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:16,380
Even so,

366
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,490
there's nothing I can do.

367
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,700
To return, they have no choice

368
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:20,750
but to obtain the talisman

369
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,490
from my past self 900 years ago.

370
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,250
We did everything we could to save you and help you

371
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,290
time and again.

372
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,180
How can you be so heartless?

373
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,810
You relied on His Lordship so much.

374
00:20:33,110 --> 00:20:33,810
So why are you...?

375
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,100
How dare you disrespect the Saintess!

376
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:40,180
If they never return to rescue you,

377
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,530
you'll remain imprisoned here for life.

378
00:20:55,590 --> 00:20:56,900
Yuwen Hao, I despise you!

379
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,900
Yamao has always considered you a friend

380
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:00,570
and never meant you any harm.

381
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:01,860
And you?

382
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,490
Is this how you repay her?

383
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:05,250
Now the talisman's shattered,

384
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:06,980
and so is her hope of saving her master.

385
00:21:07,830 --> 00:21:08,570
Duyao left her

386
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,730
covered in wounds.

387
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,050
If she doesn't make it back

388
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:11,980
safe and sound this time,

389
00:21:12,350 --> 00:21:13,570
I'll despise you for the rest of my life!

390
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,290
Consider this display

391
00:21:45,590 --> 00:21:47,330
of silver blossoms my gift.

392
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,330
May your path to immortality

393
00:21:49,550 --> 00:21:50,660
be as bright as these blossoms

394
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,290
and free of all obstacles.

395
00:21:54,510 --> 00:21:55,180
Master,

396
00:21:55,580 --> 00:21:57,200
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

397
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,860
I'd resolved to renounce love.

398
00:21:59,350 --> 00:22:00,530
But whenever I hear

399
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,050
that she's been gravely wounded

400
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,490
and that her fate is uncertain,

401
00:22:08,310 --> 00:22:09,730
I can't get her

402
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:11,860
out of my mind.

403
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:17,490
I can't let her go.

404
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:21,770
Master,

405
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:27,380
what should I do?

406
00:22:29,500 --> 00:22:32,780
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

407
00:22:46,550 --> 00:22:47,660
After all that's happened,

408
00:22:48,850 --> 00:22:50,290
why can't you just let her go?

409
00:22:53,030 --> 00:22:55,090
I just hope she dies back there, 900 years in the past,

410
00:22:56,590 --> 00:22:57,660
and never comes back.

411
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:11,360
Don't worry.

412
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:12,740
With my help behind the scenes,

413
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,230
that fellow's faith is bound

414
00:23:14,270 --> 00:23:15,140
to waver tonight.

415
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:16,800
I've also tampered with the bamboo frames

416
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:17,790
for the lanterns in the market.

417
00:23:18,030 --> 00:23:18,730
When the time comes...

418
00:23:18,730 --> 00:23:19,380
Yamao,

419
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:22,620
tonight,

420
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:24,180
you don't need to come with me.

421
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:26,330
I don't need those little tricks either.

422
00:23:28,350 --> 00:23:29,140
You don't like him anymore?

423
00:23:29,310 --> 00:23:30,530
I'm crazy about him!

424
00:23:30,880 --> 00:23:31,570
But...

425
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,250
But after he

426
00:23:35,270 --> 00:23:36,380
saw through my lies

427
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:37,860
and caught me in the act,

428
00:23:38,070 --> 00:23:38,860
I realized I should

429
00:23:38,860 --> 00:23:39,980
be sincere with him

430
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,050
instead of plotting

431
00:23:41,070 --> 00:23:42,900
one scheme after another.

432
00:23:46,070 --> 00:23:47,570
If you don't need my help,

433
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:48,860
the talisman...

434
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:53,420
Don't worry.

435
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:55,220
When the time is right,

436
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,730
I promise I'll lend you the talisman

437
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:57,660
to send you both back.

438
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:04,520
Come on!

439
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:07,000
Bravo!

440
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:13,380
Does it look nice?

441
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,010
Do you like it?

442
00:24:20,660 --> 00:24:24,900
♪Moonlight spills before Luoliang's towers♪

443
00:24:24,980 --> 00:24:29,140
♪The evening breeze caresses your face...♪

444
00:24:29,590 --> 00:24:30,900
We finally have some time to relax.

445
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:32,530
Why the long face?

446
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,460
So all those clothes

447
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:35,760
you picked out

448
00:24:35,760 --> 00:24:37,180
were for that log of a master of yours.

449
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,180
You think I don't know?

450
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:41,380
I told you to look after him,

451
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:43,050
but you ended up ripping his clothes.

452
00:24:43,350 --> 00:24:44,530
My master cares a lot about appearances.

453
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,140
If he wakes up to find himself

454
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:47,190
in rags,

455
00:24:47,190 --> 00:24:48,210
he'll be upset.

456
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:49,870
He couldn't stay upright.

457
00:24:49,870 --> 00:24:50,660
How is that my fault?

458
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:51,770
What would you like?

459
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,490
Qi Fengyin!

460
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,480
Which flavor do you think is best?

461
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,420
Ask your master.

462
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:02,730
I'll take some of this flavor.

463
00:25:03,110 --> 00:25:03,620
All right.

464
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:04,730
Here you go.

465
00:25:04,820 --> 00:25:05,380
Thanks.

466
00:25:12,300 --> 00:25:15,420
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear♪

467
00:25:15,780 --> 00:25:17,780
♪Grace in every step...♪

468
00:25:19,270 --> 00:25:20,250
I got these for you as a reward.

469
00:25:20,310 --> 00:25:20,810
Is it

470
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:21,460
sweet?

471
00:25:21,980 --> 00:25:24,380
♪The scent of pear blossoms fills the air♪

472
00:25:24,700 --> 00:25:26,860
♪Threads of karma are drawn together♪

473
00:25:27,140 --> 00:25:30,980
♪Twining around our palms, layer upon layer♪

474
00:25:31,540 --> 00:25:34,780
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear...♪

475
00:25:35,590 --> 00:25:36,980
I'm not unreasonable.

476
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,570
I've noticed every single thing

477
00:25:38,570 --> 00:25:39,490
you've done for me.

478
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:41,250
I know you like sweets,

479
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,620
so I bought you these.

480
00:25:43,350 --> 00:25:45,220
After all, we're the best of friends.

481
00:25:45,900 --> 00:25:47,780
♪Bonds and memories♪

482
00:25:48,590 --> 00:25:49,770
What other flavors do you like?

483
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:50,660
Let's get some more.

484
00:25:51,510 --> 00:25:52,900
Youyou's paying tonight, anyway.

485
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,450
I wasn't trying to please you.

486
00:25:56,750 --> 00:25:57,980
What do I need a reward for?

487
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:00,860
Fine.

488
00:26:01,310 --> 00:26:02,980
It's me who's trying to please you. Happy?

489
00:26:14,550 --> 00:26:15,920
Judging by the weather,

490
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:17,700
it might snow tonight.

491
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:18,940
That'd be nice.

492
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,570
What's so nice about that?

493
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:25,900
Don't you know?

494
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,730
It's believed

495
00:26:28,270 --> 00:26:29,010
that if it snows

496
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,050
on New Year's Eve,

497
00:26:30,350 --> 00:26:31,320
every wish you make this year

498
00:26:31,550 --> 00:26:32,770
will come true next year.

499
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,530
I've never celebrated New Year's Eve.

500
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:44,050
I've never seen snow.

501
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:55,900
So this is where

502
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:57,660
Youyou

503
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:58,900
used to live.

504
00:27:06,890 --> 00:27:07,460
Bravo!

505
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:14,700
Have you considered

506
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,530
that she could change

507
00:27:17,240 --> 00:27:18,700
her own future with her choices?

508
00:27:30,680 --> 00:27:31,380
Demons usually rule

509
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,620
their own separate mountain domains.

510
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,420
I've never seen so many

511
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,250
living together before.

512
00:27:36,510 --> 00:27:37,620
It seems you've done

513
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,940
what no other powerful demon could.

514
00:27:40,350 --> 00:27:41,010
Well,

515
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,620
ever since I was born,

516
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,050
I've always been on my own.

517
00:27:44,350 --> 00:27:45,500
That's why I've always wished

518
00:27:45,500 --> 00:27:46,740
for someone to keep me company.

519
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:49,180
Ever since I was little, my dream

520
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:50,490
has been to build

521
00:27:50,490 --> 00:27:51,310
a demon capital like this.

522
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:52,990
It's finally come true.

523
00:27:52,990 --> 00:27:58,810
- Bravo! - Bravo!

524
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,220
There's also plenty of spiritual energy here.

525
00:28:01,510 --> 00:28:02,220
As long as my people

526
00:28:02,350 --> 00:28:03,420
tend their spirit fields,

527
00:28:03,510 --> 00:28:04,530
they can provide for themselves

528
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,140
and won't go out and harm anyone.

529
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:08,530
It's just

530
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:11,090
that my people are still a little afraid of me.

531
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:13,620
I haven't learned

532
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:14,940
how to get along with them yet.

533
00:28:15,830 --> 00:28:16,770
I've always hoped

534
00:28:16,790 --> 00:28:17,730
to find someone

535
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:19,860
to help me handle the city's day-to-day affairs

536
00:28:20,510 --> 00:28:22,140
and put my people at ease.

537
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,250
So you set your sights on me

538
00:28:25,270 --> 00:28:26,290
because you wanted me

539
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:27,980
to help you run the city?

540
00:28:32,510 --> 00:28:33,770
Is that why you snuck

541
00:28:33,790 --> 00:28:34,700
into Yunyi Sect day after day

542
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:36,420
to watch me in secret?

543
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,220
You knew all along?

544
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:45,310
Do you really

545
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:46,700
underestimate me that much,

546
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:48,250
or are you just that oblivious?

547
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:02,660
Watch out!

548
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,900
I suppose you really are

549
00:29:33,900 --> 00:29:34,580
that oblivious.

550
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:41,250
You've watched me day after day,

551
00:29:42,480 --> 00:29:43,380
yet you've never realized

552
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,810
that I've been watching you too.

553
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,330
It doesn't look like it'll snow tonight.

554
00:30:35,590 --> 00:30:36,090
Qi Fengyin,

555
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:37,220
head back and wait for me

556
00:30:37,590 --> 00:30:39,660
at the Moonwatch Tower, the highest point at the Demon Queen's Palace.

557
00:30:40,880 --> 00:30:41,490
Where are you going?

558
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:43,010
You'll see.

559
00:30:48,940 --> 00:30:53,140
[Moonwatch Tower]

560
00:30:54,750 --> 00:30:55,330
Qi Fengyin,

561
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:56,090
come and see the snow!

562
00:30:57,300 --> 00:30:59,380
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil♪

563
00:30:59,380 --> 00:31:03,340
♪Blur, ensnaring you and me♪

564
00:31:04,420 --> 00:31:10,340
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

565
00:31:11,300 --> 00:31:15,020
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips...♪

566
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:17,180
I've never celebrated New Year's Eve.

567
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:19,730
I've never seen snow.

568
00:31:20,790 --> 00:31:21,530
Pear blossoms.

569
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:23,050
The flowers outside Luoliang

570
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:24,180
are blooming so early.

571
00:31:24,980 --> 00:31:27,100
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

572
00:31:27,420 --> 00:31:31,860
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

573
00:31:32,300 --> 00:31:38,380
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife, we pray our love will remain unbroken♪

574
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:42,660
♪Across vast mountains and rivers, how lucky we are to have found each other♪

575
00:31:43,020 --> 00:31:45,740
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows...♪

576
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:46,420
Shen Wangyan,

577
00:31:46,420 --> 00:31:47,740
♪Before all splendor fades...♪

578
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:50,420
next year is going to be a good one.

579
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:54,330
Yes.

580
00:31:55,590 --> 00:31:56,420
It'll be a good year.

581
00:32:11,700 --> 00:32:13,490
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil♪

582
00:32:13,490 --> 00:32:17,500
♪Blur, ensnaring you and me♪

583
00:32:18,580 --> 00:32:24,500
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world...♪

584
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:27,980
Do you like it?

585
00:32:28,310 --> 00:32:28,770
Isn't it beautiful?

586
00:32:29,140 --> 00:32:31,380
♪Our vows live on in ink...♪

587
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:31,900
It is.

588
00:32:36,030 --> 00:32:37,180
I hope the world

589
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,660
will always be

590
00:32:39,510 --> 00:32:40,420
this peaceful and safe.

591
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:50,180
After leaving Luoliang Demon Capital,

592
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:52,570
I looked

593
00:32:52,590 --> 00:32:54,180
into what happened on Mount Qihuang.

594
00:32:56,310 --> 00:32:57,420
What did you find out?

595
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:02,490
The blood of immortals and mortals ran in rivers.

596
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:04,660
Countless were killed or wounded.

597
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,090
But I don't remember any of it.

598
00:33:12,830 --> 00:33:14,050
I never did any of it,

599
00:33:16,070 --> 00:33:16,940
but now...

600
00:33:19,030 --> 00:33:20,180
You don't trust yourself anymore.

601
00:33:26,310 --> 00:33:27,140
That's all the more reason

602
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:29,220
[Moonwatch Tower]
to hurry and reclaim

603
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:29,940
all your malice.

604
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:31,980
Once you've perfected your techniques,

605
00:33:32,350 --> 00:33:33,460
perhaps your lost memories

606
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,460
will all come back.

607
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:35,460
Then you can judge

608
00:33:35,790 --> 00:33:37,330
whether those stories are true

609
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:39,700
and whether you're innocent

610
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,010
or deserve to be punished.

611
00:33:46,070 --> 00:33:47,530
Aren't you afraid I'll become the Devil Incarnate

612
00:33:48,590 --> 00:33:49,940
and do something that can't be undone?

613
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:53,520
How can you be so sure

614
00:33:53,520 --> 00:33:54,990
you'll become the Devil Incarnate?

615
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,330
The fact

616
00:33:56,350 --> 00:33:57,730
that those stories about your past

617
00:33:57,750 --> 00:33:58,620
upset you now

618
00:33:58,880 --> 00:33:59,770
already shows how much

619
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:00,660
you've changed.

620
00:34:02,510 --> 00:34:03,330
Besides...

621
00:34:08,510 --> 00:34:09,610
If you can smell

622
00:34:09,630 --> 00:34:10,610
the malice in people,

623
00:34:11,150 --> 00:34:11,990
then I can smell

624
00:34:11,990 --> 00:34:13,050
the goodness in them.

625
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,340
Based on everything we've been through,

626
00:34:16,880 --> 00:34:18,050
I hereby declare

627
00:34:18,670 --> 00:34:19,570
that you're a good man.

628
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,570
As for all those rights and wrongs,

629
00:34:22,070 --> 00:34:23,010
we can sort them out later.

630
00:34:25,190 --> 00:34:25,860
You're right.

631
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,980
Rumors can't be trusted.

632
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,570
I only trust myself.

633
00:34:36,230 --> 00:34:36,940
And you.

634
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:41,490
That's more like it.

635
00:34:42,110 --> 00:34:42,860
No more moping.

636
00:34:43,070 --> 00:34:43,860
Cheer up.

637
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:45,200
We still need to get the talisman

638
00:34:45,200 --> 00:34:46,050
and go back to save Youyou.

639
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:52,530
Please,

640
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:54,210
keep Youyou safe,

641
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:55,780
both here in the past

642
00:34:56,030 --> 00:34:57,090
and 900 years from now.

643
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:59,260
Please let me get the talisman soon

644
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:00,610
and hurry back to save my master.

645
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,900
And please let Qi Fengyin

646
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:04,900
reclaim all his malice as soon as possible.

647
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:53,570
Youyou.

648
00:35:57,510 --> 00:35:58,090
Youyou.

649
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:07,260
I brought you some pastries

650
00:36:08,070 --> 00:36:09,130
to help you regain spiritual power

651
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:10,340
and make things

652
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,340
a little easier here.

653
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:17,860
Talk about a wolf in sheep's clothing.

654
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:19,060
Who knows

655
00:36:19,060 --> 00:36:20,100
what you are really after?

656
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:21,210
If I told you

657
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:23,340
I had no idea that young friend of yours

658
00:36:23,550 --> 00:36:24,420
was the Saintess of the Tides,

659
00:36:25,150 --> 00:36:26,050
would you believe me?

660
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,420
So what if I believe you?

661
00:36:28,150 --> 00:36:29,300
Are you going to take pity on me

662
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:30,050
and let me go?

663
00:36:31,510 --> 00:36:32,090
Will you?

664
00:36:33,670 --> 00:36:34,650
The spell binding you

665
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:35,780
was cast by the Saintess.

666
00:36:36,230 --> 00:36:36,900
I can't break it.

667
00:36:37,670 --> 00:36:38,860
All I can do

668
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:40,130
is sneak you some food

669
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,690
to make things a bit easier in here.

670
00:36:46,030 --> 00:36:46,610
Are you sure

671
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:47,860
you don't want any?

672
00:36:48,280 --> 00:36:48,690
I'm sure.

673
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:08,460
Have some water.

674
00:37:08,510 --> 00:37:09,130
Slow down.

675
00:37:15,670 --> 00:37:16,340
There are more.

676
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,210
Here.

677
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:19,980
I've been so mean to you.

678
00:37:20,630 --> 00:37:21,780
Why are you still helping me?

679
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,050
Can't you even think

680
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,090
of a single reason?

681
00:37:28,510 --> 00:37:29,740
Don't I have any good qualities?

682
00:37:29,920 --> 00:37:30,300
You do.

683
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:31,900
I...

684
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:33,690
Maybe you

685
00:37:35,230 --> 00:37:36,260
remind me of my little sister.

686
00:37:37,150 --> 00:37:38,210
You have a little sister?

687
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:41,010
But once she grew up,

688
00:37:41,190 --> 00:37:42,300
she was nothing like the girl

689
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:43,170
she used to be.

690
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:44,690
She used to be free-spirited

691
00:37:45,150 --> 00:37:45,980
and thoughtless,

692
00:37:46,230 --> 00:37:47,090
just like you.

693
00:37:49,190 --> 00:37:50,290
I didn't mean it that way.

694
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:50,980
I mean...

695
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,210
You're your own person.

696
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,010
I'm sorry.

697
00:37:54,670 --> 00:37:55,980
Did I say the wrong thing again

698
00:37:56,150 --> 00:37:57,050
and upset you?

699
00:37:57,630 --> 00:37:58,340
Of course not.

700
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:00,490
You're kind to me without asking for anything.

701
00:38:00,670 --> 00:38:01,690
I couldn't be happier.

702
00:38:02,110 --> 00:38:03,730
I'd love it if everyone in the world

703
00:38:03,730 --> 00:38:04,780
treated me like their little sister.

704
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:18,690
Qingxing,

705
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,300
