759
00:44:01,630 --> 00:44:02,610
Don't underestimate me.

760
00:44:05,630 --> 00:44:06,860
Then we'll defend the city from within.

761
00:44:07,400 --> 00:44:08,260
Don't worry.

762
00:44:14,550 --> 00:44:15,260
You two should go.

763
00:44:15,760 --> 00:44:16,980
Our deal is off.

764
00:44:19,960 --> 00:44:20,940
What are you talking about?

765
00:44:23,230 --> 00:44:24,130
I lied.

766
00:44:24,550 --> 00:44:25,570
I don't have

767
00:44:25,590 --> 00:44:26,340
