797
00:45:47,630 --> 00:45:49,340
I must seal you away here for good!

798
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:50,980
What kind of nonsense is that?

799
00:45:52,030 --> 00:45:53,490
How many mountains have you cultivators claimed

800
00:45:53,840 --> 00:45:55,130
for your training over the years?

801
00:45:55,590 --> 00:45:56,780
Why won't you let us demons

802
00:45:56,840 --> 00:45:58,170
